OL,3,AFlights in Scotland, Northern Ireland
OL,4,Aand northern England disrupted by air
OL,5,Atraffic control issue
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt also says the glitch is not related
OL,8,Fto a software defect that led to the
OL,9,Fcancellation of 2,000 flights across
OL,10,Fthe UK earlier this month
